        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DarkSpase – 2222: The Solar System is Under Siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dregg have arrived. Extrasolar horrors with biomechanical wings and plasma eyes, they warp in from beyond Neptune, hungry for conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Defenders of Earth—once FTL racers pushing Keplerian limits—now scramble to defend humanity’s cradle. You are the Privateer, a legendary founder of the DoE. You walked away for a life. Now the system burns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up. Strap in. Prove you still deserve the legend.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Keplerian Simulation: NASA/JPL accurate orbits. Mercury streaks. Jupiter looms. Distances matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FTL Travel: Hands-on interactive warping between planets. Visit Mars in four minutes at 5 c.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE Starfighter Combat: Outmaneuver Dregg swarms at 150 m/s. Ride Newtonian physics on the limits with 6-degrees-of-freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Encounters: 18v18 battles at Mars. 1v1 Aces at Pluto. Your wingmen are the Defenders of Earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Customization: Change your loadout any time. Weapons, hull and shields are fully configurable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Ammo: Your starfighter's PPM (Passive Perpetual Motion) device just needs time to recharge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of Loot: Upgrades are your spoils of war. Shield-buster EMPs harvested from vanquished enemies are the literal bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime Inspiration: Lock on to entire flight groups and release volleys of seeking missiles. &lt;unnamed-giant-robot-anime&gt;-style carnage incarnate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Indie Developer: I am just one guy who made the game I've wanted to play since the '90s. Yeah, I'm using AI-generated models, music and voices (planet textures are courtesy of NASA).  I'm a programmer, not an artist or audio-engineer. Hey, I directed the prompts to get what I wanted 😉 And I did write the sun shader!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paywalls. No grind. Pure skill. Pure space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Sol. Or lose it forever.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DarkSpase – 2222: The Solar System is Under Siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dregg have arrived. Extrasolar horrors with biomechanical wings and plasma eyes, they warp in from beyond Neptune, hungry for conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Defenders of Earth—once FTL racers pushing Keplerian limits—now scramble to defend humanity’s cradle. You are the Privateer, a legendary founder of the DoE. You walked away for a life. Now the system burns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up. Strap in. Prove you still deserve the legend.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Keplerian Simulation: NASA/JPL accurate orbits. Mercury streaks. Jupiter looms. Distances matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FTL Travel: Hands-on interactive warping between planets. Visit Mars in four minutes at 5 c.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE Starfighter Combat: Outmaneuver Dregg swarms at 150 m/s. Ride Newtonian physics on the limits with 6-degrees-of-freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Encounters: 18v18 battles at Mars. 1v1 Aces at Pluto. Your wingmen are the Defenders of Earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Customization: Change your loadout any time. Weapons, hull and shields are fully configurable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Ammo: Your starfighter's PPM (Passive Perpetual Motion) device just needs time to recharge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of Loot: Upgrades are your spoils of war. Shield-buster EMPs harvested from vanquished enemies are the literal bomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime Inspiration: Lock on to entire flight groups and release volleys of seeking missiles. &lt;unnamed-giant-robot-anime&gt;-style carnage incarnate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Indie Developer: I am just one guy who made the game I've wanted to play since the '90s. Yeah, I'm using AI-generated models, music and voices (planet textures are courtesy of NASA).  I'm a programmer, not an artist or audio-engineer. Hey, I directed the prompts to get what I wanted 😉 And I did write the sun shader!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paywalls. No grind. Pure skill. Pure space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Sol. Or lose it forever.</p>",
        "short_description": "Galaga meets Tie Fighter meets Elite Dangerous. A sci-fi starfighter combat sim with NASA-accurate Keplerian orbits. Voyage across the Solar System with real-time FTL. Engage Dregg swarms in dynamic PvE encounters. Outmaneuver invaders by pushing Newtonian physics to the limit at 150 m/s.",
